-### trl rloo - Reinforce Leave One Out
-
-Online RL training where the model generates text and receives rewards based on custom criteria.
-
-**Basic usage:**
-
-```bash
-trl rloo \
-  --model_name_or_path Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B \
